meta {
  name: not supported
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/mockserver/mcp
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Documented so the behaviour is not mistaken for SSE support: MockServer's MCP endpoint does not implement the server-initiated SSE stream, and a GET is always refused.
  
  Full API reference: https://www.mock-server.com/mock_server/mockserver_clients.html
}
